io.Writer dispatch + wrap: Write wraps w.Write's error and io.ErrShortWrite in "audit: write: %w".
Writers reaching w: *os.File (stderr / audit.Open), *audit.Quota, *bytes.Buffer (3 Candidates).
Expect audit.ErrFull, io.ErrShortWrite (two sites) and (*os.File).Write's errors, every entry behind
"audit: write: %w"; os errors additionally behind (*fs.PathError).Unwrap, except os.ErrInvalid.
(The variants of poll/syscall errors without *fs.PathError are the documented || over-approximation of
filerepo_commit_decl, here inside os.(*File).wrapErr.)
-- args --
audit/audit.go:@write
